# Rust
**/target/
corpus/generate/out/

# .NET
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
# CI (hyper-pack-nuget.yml) arranges and packs these per-RID at pack time; regenerable
# locally via `cargo cdylib` (the csproj's runtimes/**/native/* wildcard item).
csharp/HyperTabular/runtimes/
# The same for the static libraries a Native AOT publish links in: staged by the forge's
# static-libs/build-static-libs.sh at test and pack time, never committed.
csharp/HyperTabular/staticlibs/

# Ruby
# CI places each leg's native lib here for `bundle exec rspec` at build-native time, and the
# gem build stages every RID's into the gem; regenerable locally via `cargo cdylib`.
ruby/lib/hypertabular/native/*/
ruby/Gemfile.lock
ruby/pkg/
ruby/.yardoc/
